# Google Maps Platform API Key (public client key for SvelteKit Maps JS API)
#
# Option 1 (Fastest for Prototyping — Zero Billing / No Cloud Project Required):
#   1. Visit https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with any Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
#   3. Click to generate and reveal your free Maps Demo Key.
#   4. Copy the key below (note: demo keys have a daily quota and are for prototyping only).
#
# Option 2 (Production Key via Google Cloud Console):
#   1. Create or select a project at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, and Geocoding API.
#   3. Restrict the key by HTTP referrer and allowed APIs before deploying.
#
# Copy this file to .env and replace the placeholder value:
#   cp .env.example .env
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
